{"schema_version":2,"catalogue_version":1,"id":"bco:22-4","provision":"BCO 22-4","book":"bco","book_name":"Book of Church Order","abbreviation":"BCO","reference":"22-4","title":"Section 22-4","supplementary":false,"canonical_url":"https://raymond-rishty.github.io/pca-ga/provisions/bco/22-4/","reader_url":"https://raymond-rishty.github.io/pca-constitution-reader/#bco/22-4","current_text":{"html":"<p>The relationship of the associate pastor to the church is determined by the congregation. The relationship of the assistant pastor to the church is determined by the Session. The dissolution of the relationship of both is governed by the provision of <i>BCO</i> 23.</p>","text":"The relationship of the associate pastor to the church is determined by the congregation. The relationship of the assistant pastor to the church is determined by the Session. The dissolution of the relationship of both is governed by the provision of BCO 23."},"source":{"name":"PCA Constitution Reader","revision":"edce8a8dcd9ced63bb585bf922e6a97319ef62e1","edition":"Current Reader text","files":{"bco.js":"c88e552545b73fd9690de620b237895b7ea52a94bed8e95690c116bf76be8ae5","wcf.js":"1ebf9e54223f7fe4e728a3e640c833a435af825d74b5ef3d4b04687685538a0d","wlc.js":"f6977e761ea4ccc93b07fcacfd0391890cb05b42f4317d807fa293c078d9b051","wsc.js":"dd775417f7ef21e3283bacad5e6ef193c41d64d03bd5a2e8fb934ccca8cb8e53","rao.js":"49808bbb0e95abdc3b07506c87dde0d62d087851e869b49c0f1f2424986450ec"}},"input_fingerprint":"94a0b54eec213ad53deb08f9fe4e387f46d90e3373f4cd38647b018d7b192c88","parent_id":"bco:22","children":[],"coverage":{"relationships":"indexed_records","recommendations":{"status":"incomplete","note":"Recommendation and study papers are not comprehensively indexed by provision."},"history":"partial"},"relationship_count":18,"relationships":[{"id":"bco:22-4--ccb_advice:inquiries/ga33_2005__ci02.md","record_id":"ccb_advice:inquiries/ga33_2005__ci02.md","type":"CCB advice","title":"Relationship of Assistant Pastor to th